+The mathematical ingredients of the construction have established antecedents. Orthogonal decomposition into exact and cycle components is standard finite graph-Hodge theory, with modern edge-flow work extending Hodge representations to richer cell-complex settings \cite{Whitney1957,Desbrun2005DEC,Jiang2011HodgeRank,Lim2020HodgeLaplacians,HoppeSchaub2024}. Cycle consistency, synchronization, and connection-Laplacian methods likewise make closed-loop compatibility a central local-to-global diagnostic \cite{Singer2011Synchronization,Bandeira2013ConnectionLaplacian,LiShiLerman2024}; the recent twisted-Laplacian analysis of Torres-Hugas \emph{et al.} makes the gauge-invariant cycle-holonomy obstruction especially explicit \cite{TorresHugas2026}. For changing support, persistent Laplacians supply a mathematically adjacent framework for nested complexes and connect graph Laplacians with effective resistance \cite{MemoliWanWang2022}.
+
+The temporal interpretation also has substantial antecedents. Internal-clock and relational-observable programs describe dynamics without treating an external scalar time as the only possible clock description \cite{PageWootters1983,HoehnSmithLock2021,Giacomini2021}; finite-resource and periodic-clock studies sharpen the operational limits and covariance of such descriptions \cite{Hausmann2025,Chataignier2026}. Churilov's finite quantum-history construction is a particularly close recent conceptual neighbor because exact history sectors and clock-change structure are organized by cycle monodromy/holonomy \cite{Churilov2026}. These works overlap with different pieces of the present construction and deserve to be read as genuine reference points rather than foils.
+
+What is model-specific here is therefore not any one of those mathematical tools or relational-clock ideas in isolation, but the consequences obtained when a real additive CAL scale-comparison cochain is taken as the primitive temporal datum of the frozen finite-event ontology: exactness becomes the criterion for completeness of positive local rates, the non-exact remainder receives the restricted interpretation of collective temporal memory, realized change is decomposed by event provenance, support change is treated without silently identifying distinct cochain spaces, and the resulting structure is tested explicitly for whether it selects its own autonomous dynamics.
 
